list.item:
Fisk, James B., U.S. Representative to
                                the Geneva Conference on the Discontinuance of Nuclear Weapon Tests;
                                also member, President’s Science Advisory Committee

Humphrey, Hubert H., Democratic Senator
                                from Minnesota; Chairman, Special Subcommittee on Disarmament,
                                Committee on Foreign Relations

Lloyd, John Selwyn Brooke, British
                                Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs until July 27, 1960;
                                thereafter Chancellor of the Exchequer

person.note:
First Secretary of the Central Committee, Communist Party of the Soviet Union;
                    Vice Chairman, Soviet Council of Ministers until March 1958; thereafter
                    Chairman

Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs from October 1958; Deputy
                    Under Secretary of State for Political Affairs, August 1959–December 1959;
                    thereafter Under Secretary of State for Political Affairs
